<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to My Front Page</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f0f2f5 0%, #b6e0fe 100%);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        header {
            background: #004aad;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 30px 0 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background: #f8f8f8;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            padding: 15px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            color: #004aad;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 18px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            color: #333;
        }
        main {
            padding: 50px 20px;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
        }
        h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        p {
            color: #222;
            font-size: 1.28rem;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }
        .btn-main {
            margin-top: 32px;
            padding: 12px 32px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            border: none;
            background: #004aad;
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-main:hover {
            background: #002f6c;
        }
        footer {
            background: #f1f1f1;
            padding: 16px 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #888;
            position: fixed;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
            main { padding: 30px 8px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Front Page</h1>
        <p>Your journey starts here.</p>
    </header>
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Features</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <main>
        <h2>Hello, World!</h2>
        <p>
            This is the main landing page. Explore our website to learn about amazing features and the exciting journey ahead.
            Start browsing to find out more about what we offer!
        </p>
        <button class="btn-main" onclick="alert('Thank you for visiting!')">Get Started</button>
    </main>
    <footer>
        © 2025 Your Website Name. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
